-/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
- *
- *                           function asinh
- *
- *  this function evaluates the inverse hyperbolic sine function.
- *
- *  author        : david vallado                  719-573-2600    1 mar 2001
- *
- *  inputs          description                    range / units
- *    xval        - angle value                                  any real
- *
- *  outputs       :
- *    arcsinh     - result                                       any real
- *
- *  locals        :
- *    none.
- *
- *  coupling      :
- *    none.
- *
- * --------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
-
