- * - Average [Beam, Group, Ut, Sat] [Fwd, Rtn] [Dev, Mac, Phy] Delay
- * - [Global, PerGw, PerBeam, PerGroup, PerUt, PerSat] [Fwd, Rtn] [Feeder, User] [Dev, Mac, Phy]
- * LinkDelay
