- *
- *  Expected result:
- *    Correct number of entities: 351 satellites, 3 GWs, 3 UTs, 702 ISLs
- *    Each satellite has 4 ISL interfaces
- *    All satellites know on which interface to send a packet depending on a target satellite
- */
